{"data":"<div class=\"rounded bg-white h-100\">\r\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n        <div class=\"p-3\">\r\n            <div id=\"player\" class=\"d-none\"><\/div>\r\n            <h1 class=\"m-0 font-weight-600\">[U10-P3]\u30c9\u30ea\u30eb<\/h1>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"activity-quiz-history-body ml-3\">\r\n                            <div class=\"activity-quiz-history-description custom-bg-gray rounded p-1 ck-content\">\r\n                    <p><strong>1. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau:<\/strong> gi\u00fap h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean ghi nh\u1edb v\u00e0 hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1ch \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp c\u00e1c k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng: nghe, \u0111\u1ecdc.<\/p><p><strong>2. H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn:<\/strong> h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c b\u00e0i Drill luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00e1c d\u1ea1ng b\u00e0i sau:<\/p><p>- Nghe v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n \u0111\u00fang. (B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch k\u00e9o th\u1ea3, tick ch\u1ecdn, g\u00f5 \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n \u0111\u00fang,...)<\/p><p>- \u0110\u1ecdc v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n \u0111\u00fang. (B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch k\u00e9o th\u1ea3, tick ch\u1ecdn, g\u00f5 \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n \u0111\u00fang,...)<\/p><p><strong>3. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh:<\/strong> k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ea1t &gt;=8 (thang \u0111i\u1ec3m 10)<\/p><p>* L\u01b0u \u00fd: c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n, l\u1ea5y \u0111i\u1ec3m cao nh\u1ea5t.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"d-flex-not-important align-items-center my-3\">\r\n                    <a class=\"rounded btn btn-outline-primary max-content mr-2\" class=\"\"  href=\"https:\/\/digital.nix.edu.vn\/learning\/activity\/download-quiz-pdf\/2371?html=0\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-download\"><\/i>\r\n                        Download sample as PDF\r